        "x-connect-family-policy-notes": "Membership requires the action-specific named scope, current manager/member or invitation-target authority, same tenant and recipient ceilings. Preserve operation_id, expected_revision and normalized action for identical replay. A changed intent conflicts. Original member epoch is immutable; current authorization is required for status and replay. Only the original same-epoch self-removal receipt is readable while inactive. Query snapshots require current membership. Personal invitations are pending/live/unexpired only, count <=100 and encoded page <=384KiB, using a 30-second identity/credential/tenant/scope-bound opaque fixed-high-water cursor. New inserts require a fresh query; it is not a retained immutable snapshot.",
